{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VL85 \u2013 Twin-section AC freight locomotive for mountain railways</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The VL85 is a powerful twin-section AC electric freight locomotive, specifically developed for hauling heavy trains on the challenging gradients of the Baikal\u2013Amur Mainline. It was designed and manufactured by the Novocherkassk Electric Locomotive Plant between 1983 and 1994.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first prototype units underwent testing in the Ukrainian SSR, where their traction performance, subsystem reliability, regenerative braking, and electronic control systems were thoroughly evaluated under demanding operating conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features of the ZDSimulator model:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly detailed exterior with accurate design elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated driver's cab with functional control instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully operational control system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic traction, braking, and auxiliary sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Working lights (headlights, beams, interior)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support for regenerative braking and realistic physics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The VL85 is ideal for routes with steep profiles, long uphill sections, and heavy freight consists.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614880?t=1744917894","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614880/74533c9cbf7fc1e6ba311edc3ce8b113e8c12c46/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744917894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614880/bc4d8eac6e5489724ae7f89ee1c66ce7d70a5ffa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744917894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614880/bc4d8eac6e5489724ae7f89ee1c66ce7d70a5ffa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744917894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VL85 \u2013 Twin-section AC freight locomotive for mountain railways</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The VL85 is a powerful twin-section AC electric freight locomotive, specifically developed for hauling heavy trains on the challenging gradients of the Baikal\u2013Amur Mainline. It was designed and manufactured by the Novocherkassk Electric Locomotive Plant between 1983 and 1994.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first prototype units underwent testing in the Ukrainian SSR, where their traction performance, subsystem reliability, regenerative braking, and electronic control systems were thoroughly evaluated under demanding operating conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features of the ZDSimulator model:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly detailed exterior with accurate design elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated driver's cab with functional control instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully operational control system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic traction, braking, and auxiliary sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Working lights (headlights, beams, interior)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support for regenerative braking and realistic physics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The VL85 is ideal for routes with steep profiles, long uphill sections, and heavy freight consists.</p>","developers":["ZDSimulator Team"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3381120","name":"ZDSimulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614880/00aa32a63dd99e23095cb870d43e887484513cfd/header.jpg?t=17449178